ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/55/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/06/21/283462834/d2972c634d9d81979774b22b49d1ab01_887661176891008491.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e可莉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e炽烈的炎之魔女能为可莉带来不俗的火元素伤害加成以及火元素相关元素反应的加成，但可莉叠层速度不快，纯火流通常搭配2魔女+2攻击、4\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/1602/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e渡过烈火的贤人\u003c/a\u003e或者4魔女，蒸发流搭配为2魔女+2精通或者4\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/1638/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e流浪大地的乐团\u003c/a\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比/元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e火元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1627\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/8980427ee3cecce2a46400d2c0af6d20_4290442929626456243.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"胡桃\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1627/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1627/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/8980427ee3cecce2a46400d2c0af6d20_4290442929626456243.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e胡桃\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u0